<title>USA: Coventry Corp to sell health plan offices.</title>
<headline>Coventry Corp to sell health plan offices.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coventry Corp said Tuesday it signed a definitive agreement for the sale of its Group Health Plan unit's nine medical practices located throughout the St. Louis area to BJC Health System.</p>
<p>The sale is expected to result in an after-tax gain to Coventry of about $7 million, Coventry said.</p>
<p>In connection with the sale, BJC and Group Health Plan will also enter into a 10-year agreement for provision of health care services for a fixed percentage of premium, Coventry said.</p>
